cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use camt053-loader-mt942 in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camt053-loader-mt942: SWIFT MT942 to ISO 20022 camt.052 loader"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that converts legacy SWIFT MT942 interim transaction
  reports into the camt053 ParsedDocument model as ISO 20022 camt.052
  Bank-to-Customer Account Reports, so every consumer in the camt053 suite
  reads MT942 the same way it reads native camt.052.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.23"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/camt053-loader-mt942"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/camt053-loader-mt942/"
keywords:
  - ISO 20022
  - camt.052
  - MT942
  - SWIFT
  - interim transaction report
  - bank statements
